    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the detail. what about the abdomen itself? i'm worried about what might be happening deep in the rumen where i cant reach. like if a bad bacteria starts spreading or something hidden starts causing trouble inside there...",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
